%% Controlled drawing: sdk_api_sequence
%% Title: Submit, poll, fetch artifacts
%% Describes: protoDIRSIG SDK API, contract sdk-api/1, proposed (api/operations.md)
%% Source of truth: this file. Rendered to sdk_api_sequence.svg and sdk_api_sequence.png by scripts/render_diagrams.py; docs reference the PNG.
%% Change this file and re-render in the same commit as the code or document change it follows.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User or notebook
  participant F as SDK facade
  participant B as Backend (local or remote)
  participant E as Engine (DIRSIG)

  U->>F: submit_sweep(recipe)
  F->>B: submit_sweep
  B->>B: compose, then admit every run (the engine-free checks of validate)
  alt any run fails admission
    B-->>F: 422 problem: every failing run, with layer and field
    F-->>U: raises the problem, and no run is created
  else all runs admitted
    B-->>F: 202: sweep id, run ids, each run accepted
    F-->>U: sweep status
    B-)E: execute each run (asynchronous): dry run, then render
  end

  loop until every run is final
    U->>F: get_sweep(sweep_id)
    F->>B: get_sweep
    B-->>F: each run: accepted, running, rendered, failed or cancelled
    F-->>U: sweep status
  end
  E--)B: run rendered: image, header, truth, logs written

  U->>F: list_artifacts(run_id)
  F->>B: list_artifacts
  B-->>F: references {name, sha256, media_type, uri}
  F-->>U: artifact references
  U->>F: get_artifact(run_id, name)
  F->>B: get_artifact
  B-->>F: bytes and media type
  F-->>U: bytes, whose sha256 equals the reference's
